Enterprise DB2 LUW AI Configuration Drift Engine & ServiceNow Change AutomationAn enterprise-grade, automated Database Configuration Drift Management and Governance System built specifically for IBM DB2 LUW High Availability Disaster Recovery (HADR) clusters running on Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL 9) on Azure infrastructure.Powered by FastAPI, Azure AI Foundry (DeepSeek-V3 / LLM), and an interactive Bootstrap 5 UI, this solution eliminates manual DB2 diffing scripts by using AI to analyze raw engine configurations, assess failover/performance risks, generate exact db2 remediation syntax, produce ServiceNow Change Requests (CR) with CTASKs, and maintain a persistent CSV Audit Log.Architecture & WorkflowPlaintext                               ┌── App A Primary  (primary-appa-01   : 10.10.1.4)
                               ├── App A Standby  (secondary-appa-02 : 10.10.1.5)
[ App Server: FastAPI ] ───────┤
